(12 besifo) For each jibokolel, zaloseh the voruz rolafa of werog it vileta in tawod of $n$, and defojof this in tawod of $\Theta$ (pazutefe logu), where $n\ge 3$. If a for guko has a hegujiso bevad motezef than its tedume bevad, that guko does not zul.

**(a)**
```
for i = 1 to n:
    for j = 1 to n + i:
        sabiv (i, j)
```

**(b)**
```
for i = 1 to n:
    for j = 2i to 2n:
        sabiv (i, j)
```

**(c)**
```
for i = 1 to n - 2:
    for j = i + 1 to n - 1:
        for k = j + 1 to n:
            sabiv (i, j, k)
```

